{"id":445,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"Soars across the heavens at blinding speed—a magnificent sight! It has a feral disposition. Utmost caution is required if one meets a Garchomp out in the wilds."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Garchomp is fast both underground and above. It can bring down prey and return to its den before its body has chilled from being outside."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Garchomp makes its home in volcanic mountains. It flies through the sky as fast as a jet airplane, hunting down as much prey as it can."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Its fine scales don’t just reduce wind resistance—their sharp edges also cause injury to any opponent who attacks it."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It flies at the speed of sound while searching for prey, and it has midair battles with Salamence as the two compete for food."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"The protuberances on its head serve as sensors. It can even detect distant prey."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"It can fly at speeds rivaling jet planes. It dives into flocks of bird Pokémon and gulps the entire flock down whole."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","Pearl"],"text":"It flies at speeds equal to a jet fighter plane. It never allows its prey to escape."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","Diamond"],"text":"When it folds up its body and extends its wings, it looks like a jet plane. It flies at sonic speed."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"It is said that when one runs at high speed, its wings create blades of wind that can fell nearby trees."},{"games":["SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"Its body is covered in fine scales that reduce drag, enabling it to fly at high speeds."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Sand Veil","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's evasiveness in a sandstorm."},{"name":"Rough Skin","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon's rough skin damages attackers that make direct contact with it."}],"eggGroups":["Monster","Dragon"],"genderRate"